<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The themed-icon layer, for launchers that recolour every icon to match the
  wallpaper.

  The same shapes in one colour, because that is all a monochrome layer can be:
  the system throws the colours away and tints the alpha. Kept as its own file
  rather than pointing the monochrome slot at the foreground, so that changing
  the red or the blue there cannot quietly change what a themed icon looks
  like.
-->
